t":"tiro"},{"page":0,"x":112,"y":197.5,"w":446,"h":12,"text":"Job Title: {{contactTitle}}","size":9.96,"font":"tiro"},{"page":0,"x":112,"y":209.0,"w":446,"h":12,"text":"Street Address: {{street}}","size":9.96,"font":"tiro"},{"page":0,"x":112,"y":220.5,"w":446,"h":12,"text":"City, State, Postal Code: {{cityState}}","size":9.96,"font":"tiro"},{"page":0,"x":112,"y":232.0,"w":446,"h":12,"text":"Country: {{country}}","size":9.96,"font":"tiro"},{"page":0,"x":112,"y":243.5,"w":446,"h":12,"text":"Phone Number: {{contactPhone}}","size":9.96,"font":"tiro"},{"page":0,"x":112,"y":255.0,"w":446,"h":12,"text":"Fax Number: {{fax}}","size":9.96,"font":"tiro"},{"page":0,"x":112,"y":266.5,"w":446,"h":12,"text":"E-mail Address: {{contactEmail}}","size":9.96,"font":"tiro"},{"page":0,"x":54,"y":289,"w":504,"h":13,"text":"CARROLLTON COURTYARD CORPORATE GUEST ROOM RATES","size":10,"font":"tibo"},{"page":0,"x":54,"y":302,"w":504,"h":27,"text":"The Hotel's published Corporate Rates are the best available rates offered to a typical business traveler. The 2027 published corporate rates are subject to change without notice:","size":9.96,"font":"tiro"},{"page":0,"x":54,"y":397,"w":504,"h":13,"text":"{{company}} CORPORATE GUEST ROOM RATES","size":10,"font":"tibo"},{"page":0,"x":54,"y":411,"w":504,"h":27,"text":"We are pleased to extend the following Special Rates to {{company}} business travelers beginning 01/01/2027 THROUGH 12/31/2027.","size":9.96,"font":"tiro"},{"page":0,"x":54,"y":516,"w":504,"h":61,"text":"These rates are {{availabilityText}} and are net non-commissionable. These rates do not include applicable state and local taxes. Throughout the next quarter we will review the volume of room nights actualized by {{company}}. The CARROLLTON COURTYARD reserves the right to re-evaluate your productivity quarterly to see if your volume continues to warrant this discount.","size":9.96,"font":"tiro"},{"page":0,"x":54,"y":585,"w":504,"h":13,"text":"COMMITMENT:","size":10,"font":"tibo"},{"page":0,"x":54,"y":600,"w":504,"h":40,"text":"CARROLLTON COURTYARD commits to honor these rates and {{company}} agrees to communicate with its frequent travelers, naming CARROLLTON COURTYARD as one of its preferred hotels in CARROLLTON, TEXAS.","size":9.96,"font":"tiro"},{"page":0,"x":54,"y":649,"w":504,"h":28,"text":"As part of our agreement with {{company}}, we will provide the following:","size":9.96,"font":"tiro"},{"page":1,"x":54,"y":55,"w":504,"h":41,"text":"Quarterly Performance Updates. These easy-to-read updates will include information on the number of room nights utilized per month, day of week usage, booking sources, travel agency usage, and room night usage, volume commitments and achievements.","size":9.96,"font":"tiro"},{"page":1,"x":54,"y":106,"w":504,"h":72,"text":"Semi-Annual Review Meeting. This semi-annual update will give you a complete picture of your traveler's use of the CARROLLTON COURTYARD noted in this agreement. We will review your room night production, reservation sources, total hotel revenues, and traveler satisfaction. The Semi-Annual Review meeting will provide us an opportunity to discuss any particular challenges or concerns that you or your travelers may have with the CARROLLTON COURTYARD. We will also review our strategic plan for assisting your company to obtain room night production, discuss results, and talk about upcoming initiatives.","size":9.96,"font":"tiro"},{"page":1,"x":54,"y":187,"w":504,"h":13,"text":"BILLING PROCEDURES:","size":10,"font":"tibo"},{"page":1,"x":54,"y":202,"w":504,"h":30,"text":"All guestroom charges including room and tax and/or incidentals will be the responsibility of the individual traveler. If a traveler does not have a credit card, a cash deposit will be required upon check-in at the front desk.","size":9.96,"font":"tiro"},{"page":1,"x":54,"y":239,"w":504,"h":13,"text":"MARRIOTT BONVOY:","size":10,"font":"tibo"},{"page":1,"x":54,"y":254,"w":504,"h":74,"text":"Any {{company}} business traveler may become a Member of Marriott Bonvoy at no cost and with no minimum stay. Marriott Bonvoy is Marriott International's travel program comprised of a portfolio of extraordinary brands designed to enable Members to explore the world in pursuit of their passions. Guests may join Marriott Bonvoy by visiting MarriottBonvoy.com or at the front desk of any Participating Property. Marriott Bonvoy Members are eligible for benefits in accordance with the then-current Marriott Bonvoy Terms and Conditions. The Terms and Conditions are available at https://www.marriott.com/loyalty/terms/default.mi.","size":9.96,"font":"tiro"},{"page":1,"x":54,"y":337,"w":504,"h":51,"text":"To accept this agreement, please sign and return the enclosed copy. Upon receipt of the executed agreement, we will enter your special corporate rate into our system. Please keep a copy of this agreement for your records. In the event a fully signed original of this Agreement is not received by {{acceptByDisplay}} CARROLLTON COURTYARD reserves the right to renegotiate these terms.","size":9.96,"font":"tiro"},{"page":1,"x":54,"y":399,"w":504,"h":13,"text":"HIGH RISK ACTIVITIES:","size":10,"font":"tibo"},{"page":1,"x":54,"y":414,"w":504,"h":85,"text":"Hotel has committed to providing the room nights and function space, as applicable, set forth in this Agreement based on information about the event that {{company}} has given to the Hotel. {{company}} agrees that it has presented all material information required in order for Hotel to provide the rooms and facilities set forth in this Agreement. Should Hotel, in its sole reasonable discretion, determine at any time that the Event will include a high-risk activity that was previously undisclosed to the Hotel (including by way of example, and not by limitation, biological agents, pyrotechnics, etc.), Hotel may terminate this Agreement immediately and without liability, upon written notice to {{company}}.","size":9.96,"font":"tiro"},{"page":1,"x":54,"y":508,"w":504,"h":13,"text":"SIGNATURES:","size":10,"font":"tibo"},{"page":1,"x":54,"y":523,"w":504,"h":24,"text":"Approved and authorized by {{company}}","size":9.96,"font":"tiro"},{"page":1,"x":54,"y":553,"w":235,"h":14,"text":"Name: {{contactName}}","size":9.96,"font":"tiro"},{"page":1,"x":310,"y":553,"w":248,"h":14,"text":"Signature: __________________________","size":9.96,"font":"tiro"},{"page":1,"x":54,"y":579,"w":235,"h":14,"text":"Title: {{contactTitle}}","size":9.96,"font":"tiro"},{"page":1,"x":310,"y":579,"w":248,"h":14,"text":"Date: ______________________________","size":9.96,"font":"tiro"},{"page":1,"x":54,"y":614,"w":504,"h":14,"text":"Approved and authorized by Hotel:","size":9.96,"font":"tiro"},{"page":1,"x":54,"y":640,"w":235,"h":14,"text":"Name: Yohandra Portelles","size":9.96,"font":"tiro"},{"page":1,"x":310,"y":640,"w":248,"h":14,"text":"Signature: __________________________","size":9.96,"font":"tiro"},{"page":1,"x":54,"y":666,"w":235,"h":14,"text":"Title: Director of Sales","size":9.96,"font":"tiro"},{"page":1,"x":310,"y":666,"w":248,"h":14,"text":"Date: ______________________________","size":9.96,"font":"tiro"}],"size":16,"root":1,"previousXref":11121}